{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"通天 - 标签","description":"这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。","home_page_url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","language":"zh-CN","icon":"https://acuherb.xyz/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://acuherb.xyz/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.png"}],"items":[{"title":"通天第七十二","date_published":"2025-10-01T19:20:11&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-08-28T02:31:10Z","id":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-72/","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-72/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://gravatar.loli.net/avatar/89719985bb81a6f9d508808413f1b999?s=32&amp;d=mp"}],"tags":["通天"],"summary":"天，指先天禀赋。因文中主要论述人体的素质有阴阳气血偏多偏少之分，而这种差异皆出于先天禀赋，所以篇名为\u0026quot;通天\u0026quot;。","content_html":"天，指先天禀赋。因文中主要论述人体的素质有阴阳气血偏多偏少之分，而这种差异皆出于先天禀赋，所以篇名为\u0026quot;通天\u0026quot;。"}]}